      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Secrets by NAME ONLY - values live in Fly and GitHub Actions secrets, never in this repo: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY -\nQDRANT_URL - QDRANT_API_KEY - LOGFIRE_TOKEN - LOGFIRE_READ_TOKEN - FRONTEND_ORIGIN.",
