      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The honest gap: CI lints, tests and gates the\nresearch loop, but deploys nothing. The same push\nthat starts ci.yml also triggers Vercel, on a\nseparate webhook; the backend waits on a human.",
      "originalText": "The honest gap: CI lints, tests and gates the research loop, but deploys nothing. The same push that starts ci.yml also triggers Vercel, on a separate webhook; the backend waits on a human.",
